    AVAILABLE --> LOCKED : User selects seat (10 min TTL)
    LOCKED --> BOOKED : Payment success
    LOCKED --> AVAILABLE : Payment timeout / failure
    BOOKED --> [*] : Show complete
```

**Observable outcome:** State machine: The booking flow: User B gets a graceful "This seat is currently being held by another user" message — not a race condition with undefined behavior.

